    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player adventure game in third person. A pause menu is available. Options to change screen resolution, window size, and graphics settings. In this game, a meteor is falling, and it is up to you to find a way to stop it. You will find weapons and shields to equip. Shops allow you to purchase or make healing potions to restore your health and magic. Find masks with varying affects. There are a few ways to save the world, with or without a companion. In third person the player will perform mild platforming and combat with monsters, with a heavier focus on world traversal and inventory collection / management.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a single player adventure game in third person. A pause menu is available. Options to change screen resolution, window size, and graphics settings. In this game, a meteor is falling, and it is up to you to find a way to stop it. You will find weapons and shields to equip. Shops allow you to purchase or make healing potions to restore your health and magic. Find masks with varying affects. There are a few ways to save the world, with or without a companion. In third person the player will perform mild platforming and combat with monsters, with a heavier focus on world traversal and inventory collection / management.</p>",
    "short_description": "Single player adventure game in third person mode. Mild puzzle solving elements shroud a world in imminent danger! Explore the world, collect ingredients, and weapons to arm yourself against many odd foes. Find one of many ways to save the world!",
